+$\eta>0$. Suppose $0<P<1$ and $q_c=1/m$ for every correct mode. Then
+\begin{equation}
+ \E[D(q^+)]<1-1/m,
+ \qquad \E[q_c^+]=1/m.
+ \label{eq:stochastic-strict-decrease}
+\end{equation}
