+For a fixed vector $v$, Taylor expansion about uniform logits gives
+\[
+ \sum_c\operatorname{softmax}(\eta v)_c^2
+ =\frac1m+\frac{\eta^2}{m^2}\sum_c(v_c-\bar v)^2+O(\eta^3),
+ \qquad \bar v=\frac1m\sum_cv_c.
+\]
