+The thresholds for Dr.GRPO and the specified MaxRL estimator are, respectively,
+\[
+ \rho>\frac{G-1}{G}(1-P),\qquad
+ \rho>\frac{(1-P)[1-(1-P)^{G-1}]}{P}.
